#   clavicle band 6: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   clavicle band 6: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   clavicle band 9: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   clavicle band 9: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   upperarm band 1: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   upperarm band 1: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
#   upperarm band 2: rotated cross-section — the axes cannot say it
#   upperarm band 2: paint splits mid-band — colour boundary owed
